	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["2BCC19D4C7B153A1"]
			description: ["&a&lEvery journey&r&r into the world of &2&lMekanism&r&r begins with a single step, and yours starts with the &9&lgleaming blue&r&r of &9&lOsmium Ore&r&r. This versatile resource is the backbone of many &2&lMekanism technologies&r&r, and it's abundant in the world around you. Grab your trusty &6&lpickaxe&r&r and delve into the depths, seeking out the &9&lshimmering veins&r&r of &9&lOsmium Ore&r&r. Once you've gathered a hefty haul, it's time to feel the &4&lheat of the furnace&r&r. Smelt your hard-earned &9&lOsmium Ore&r&r into sturdy &9&lOsmium Ingots&r&r, the first building blocks on your path to &2&lmechanical mastery&r&r. Remember, even the grandest machine started with a single ingot."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
