		{
			dependencies: ["31FAAFE77D5C3B99"]
			description: [
				"&7&lIt's time to bring a touch of intelligence to your Mekanism journey. &a&lControl Circuits&r&r, the 'thinking stones' of the mechanical world, are the next step on your path. These ingenious devices are the brains behind many Mekanism machines and tools, with different tiers of Control Circuits required for more advanced creations."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"从 Energized Smelter 的 &9&lBasic Control Circuits&r&r 到 Chemical Dissolution Chamber 的 &4&lUltimate Control Circuits&r&r，这些组件是释放你新兴机械帝国全部潜力的关键。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"那么，收集资源，准备好制作你的第一个&a&l控制电路&r&r。智能机械的时代即将来临。"
			]
