		{
			dependencies: ["51AD28E94B85E990"]
			description: [
				"&f&lWith the power of metallurgy at your fingertips, it's time to turn your gaze skyward. The &e&lsun&r&r, that ever-present beacon in the sky, is more than just a source of light; it's a wellspring of untapped power. Your next step in the &2&lMekanism&r&r journey is to craft a &e&lSolar Generator&r&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"这款环保奇迹能捕捉太阳光，将其转化为机器所需的稳定能量流。虽然发电量不大，但太阳能发电机能在白天提供被动、可再生的电力，减轻主储能设备的负担。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"请记住，这只是个开始。未来还有&6&l高级太阳能发电机&r&r，它将把你的太阳能生产带到新的高度。太阳能时代的黎明即将来临。"
			]
