			dependencies: ["2A068A8BBAE33D0F"]
			description: [
				"&7&lWith the Metallurgic Infuser humming with power,&r&r it's time to delve into the heart of &2&lMekanism&r&r crafting: &6&lAlloys&r&r. These potent combinations of materials are the lifeblood of advanced machinery and tools. Your first task? Infuse &7&lIron&r&r with the mystical properties of &4&lRedstone&r&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"此融合将创造&6&lInfused Alloys&r&r，许多&2&lMekanism&r&r配方中的关键组件。从基础的&a&lEnergy Tablet&r&r到先进的&b&lRobit&r&r，这些合金是你科技帝国的基石。"
				""
