			dependencies: ["0F83FE7F3C3C01C2"]
			description: ["&7&lWith the fires of industry burning brightly and steel production in full swing, it's time to master the art of energy transfer. Your next challenge is to craft a &6&lThermodynamic Conductor&r&r, Mekanism's ingenious solution for transferring power in the form of heat. But remember, not all environments are created equal. The efficiency of your conductor will depend on the biome it's in. &c&lWarmer biomes&r&r will allow for higher transfer efficiency, losing less heat, while &b&lcolder biomes&r&r will result in more heat loss. So, choose your location wisely and let the warmth flow. The age of energy distribution is here.&r&r"]
