		{
			dependencies: ["0F83FE7F3C3C01C2"]
			description: [
				"随着&7&l钢铁&r&r时代的全面到来，是时候让你的工业帝国焕发生机了。作为运营命脉的&a&l加压管道&r&r，将是你的下一个制作目标。这些工程奇迹旨在将&b&l气体&r&r快速高效地输送到不断扩张的基地各处。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Remember, a Pressurized Tube is more than just a pipe; it's a &6&llifeline&r&r for your machines, delivering the vital gases they need to operate. With the ability to upgrade for increased flow rate and capacity, these tubes will keep your machines humming and your empire growing."
