		{
			dependencies: ["0F83FE7F3C3C01C2"]
			description: ["&7&lWith the age of steel in full swing and the hum of your machines as your constant companion, it's time to bridge the gap between power and progress. Your next step is to craft a &9&lUniversal Cable&r&r, the lifeline of your growing empire. These cables are the veins of your operation, capable of transferring not only Mekanism's &b&lJoules&r&r but also a variety of other power types like &4&lRedstone Flux&r&r, &5&lMinecraftjoules&r&r, and &6&lEnergy Units&r&r. This flexibility allows you to harness the power of different mods, all while maintaining a unified infrastructure. So, gather your resources and prepare to light up your world. The era of seamless energy transfer begins now.&r&r"]
