		{
			dependencies: ["60E6F5615F239BBE"]
			description: ["&a&lWith the hum&r&r of your &9&lEnrichment Chamber&r&r as your soundtrack, it's time to take your efficiency to the next level. The &2&lPurification Chamber&r&r is your next step, a machine that uses &b&loxygen&r&r to refine ores into clumps. Each ore you process yields &3&lthree clumps&r&r, tripling your output and maximizing your resources. The oxygen can be provided externally or internally with an &b&loxygen-filled Gas Tank&r&r. For example, a single &6&lCopper Ore&r&r can be transformed into three &6&lCopper Clumps&r&r, which can then be processed further in your &9&lCrusher&r&r and &9&lEnrichment Chamber&r&r. And as a bonus, you can even turn &7&lgravel&r&r into &8&lflint&r&r. Remember, &2&lpurity&r&r is the path to progress. So, gather your resources and prepare to enter the age of &2&lpurification&r&r. Your &2&lMekanism&r&r empire is about to reach new heights."]
