		{
			dependencies: ["0222248D217AD1B2"]
			description: [
				"&a&lWith the purity of your resources ensured,&r&r it's time to delve into the world of &6&lchemical reactions&r&r. The &2&lChemical Injection Chamber&r&r is your next step, a machine that uses &b&lHydrogen Chloride gas&r&r to turn ores into &4&lfour shards&r&r. This is the beginning of &5&lquadruple ore processing&r&r, a leap forward in efficiency that will require a steady supply of &b&lHydrogen Chloride&r&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"要让你的&2&l化学注射室&r&r持续运行，你需要一个&6&l热蒸发厂&r&r。但回报丰厚。除了将矿石产量提高四倍，&2&l化学注射室&r&r还能将&7&l水蒸气&r&r和&8&l泥土&r&r转化为&9&l黏土&r&r。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
